{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Soul Card Duel</strong> is a 2D roguelite adventure where every step matters. <br>Explore a procedurally generated world where any tile could be your last.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/be2c471967cba26751c553d0b5b06aa1.poster.avif?t=1758039877\" width=1170 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/be2c471967cba26751c553d0b5b06aa1.webm?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/be2c471967cba26751c553d0b5b06aa1.mp4?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survive against the odds, venture into mysterious regions, and uncover their cultures to claim priceless treasures.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/ccbec400fe647d5ce489ab573b982bb0.poster.avif?t=1758039877\" width=1170 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/ccbec400fe647d5ce489ab573b982bb0.webm?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/ccbec400fe647d5ce489ab573b982bb0.mp4?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Upgrade your gear in multiple ways, discover powerful synergies between your cards, and build decks tailored to your playstyle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/652c3cd7ef88f074bed6ec4c64339cf6.poster.avif?t=1758039877\" width=1170 height=220 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/652c3cd7ef88f074bed6ec4c64339cf6.webm?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/652c3cd7ef88f074bed6ec4c64339cf6.mp4?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Master a unique blend of tactical combat and card strategy, where wit can triumph over brute force. Customize your hero and fight for a place in the ultimate tournament.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c3285e87e30d5060e765941f9a7104e7.poster.avif?t=1758039877\" width=780 height=438 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c3285e87e30d5060e765941f9a7104e7.webm?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/extras/c3285e87e30d5060e765941f9a7104e7.mp4?t=1758039877\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0<br>\u00a0</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3938290?t=1758039877","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/f4224b3f6d4edbcc9e07c8c17bd7e14f109466e9/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1758039877","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1758039877","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3938290/d364004ffd4c0082d1e9567c3361424217274d49/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1758039877